Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,《指环王》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我钓到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我钓到一条鱼了，史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a fish, Smeag. Smeagol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快钓上来，快呀，加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it in. Go on. Go on. Go on. Pull it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,德戈！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deagol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,德戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,德戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好兄弟，把那玩意给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us that, Deagol, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是我生日，我要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's my birthday and I wants it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们咒骂我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cursed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还说我们是杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Murderer" they called us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们诅咒我们，然后把我们赶走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cursed us and drove us away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们哭得好惨，宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we wept, precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好孤单，哭得好惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wept to be so alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,湖水好清凉，脚底板好舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and cool. So nice for feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只想抓到一条大鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we only wish To catch a fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,池塘的鱼儿好甘甜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So juicy sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们忘记面包的滋味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we forgot the taste of bread...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,树木的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sound of trees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,和轻柔的微风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the softness of the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至忘记自己的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We even forgot our own name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,爱睡虫，醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, sleepies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must go, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得马上出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must go at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，你都没睡吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you had any sleep, Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡过头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gone and had too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,天色一定很晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be getting late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,并不晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,都还没过中午{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't midday yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,天空越来越阴暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The days are growing darker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧，没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must go! No time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多得先吃点东西再走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not before Mr. Frodo's had something to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不能浪费时间啦，笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No time to lose, silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不饿，反正我不爱吃兰巴斯干粮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, I'm not hungry. Leastways, not for lembas bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,干粮剩不多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have that much left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要省点吃，不然很快就会吃完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to be careful or we're going to run out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你先吃吧，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go ahead and eat that, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我算过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've rationed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这趟路应该够吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There should be enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哪趟路？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,回家的路呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The journey home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，小哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Hobbitses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very close now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到魔多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very close to Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No safe places here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,《国王归来》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这好棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是来自夏尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely from the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,长底烟草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Longbottom Leaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得好像又回到绿龙旅店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I'm back at The Green Dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绿龙旅店 - 手里拿着一杯黑啤酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Green Dragon. - A mug of ale in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了一整天，把脚翘起来休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Putting my feet up on a settle after a hard day's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来就没辛苦过一整天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only, you've never done a hard day's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,各位大爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, my lords...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临艾辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Isengard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好小子，咱们拼了老命找你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You young rascals! A merry hunt you've led us on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们却在这儿大吃大喝，还在抽烟斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now we find you feasting and... and smoking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打了一场大胜仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are sitting on a field of victory...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然要好好享受战果罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enjoying a few well-earned comforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这块腌猪肉超好吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The salted pork is particularly good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,腌猪肉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salted pork?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈比人 - 我们奉了树须的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hobbits. - We're under orders from Treebeard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他接管了艾辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who's taken over management of Isengard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young Master Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you've come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我能处理树和水、岩石和货物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wood and water, stock and stone I can master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这儿有一个巫师要对付{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is a wizard to manage here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他被关在高塔上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}locked in his tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现身吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然萨鲁曼被击败，他还是很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even in defeat, Saruman is dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的头砍掉不就结了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's just have his head and be done with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不能杀死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need him alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要问他话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need him to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你身经百战、杀敌无数，希优顿王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have fought many wars and slain many men, Theoden King...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又能维持和平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and made peace afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我们不能像以前一样一起共商国事吗，老友？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we not take counsel together as we once did, my old friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我不能和平共处吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we not have peace, you and I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall have peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以和平共处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall have peace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你为燃烧的西谷…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you answer for the burning of the Westfold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,…以及死在那儿的孩童付出惨痛的代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the children that lie dead there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以和平共处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall have peace when the lives of the soldiers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们为在号角堡前壮烈牺牲的勇士…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose bodies were hewn even as they lay dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,…向你报仇雪恨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against the gates of the Hornburg, are avenged!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当你被吊在绞架上成为乌鸦嘴里的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you hang from a gibbet for the sport of your own crows...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能和平共处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall have peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,绞架和乌鸦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbets and crows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,老糊涂！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dotard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底要什么，灰袍甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want, Gandalf Greyhame?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜，欧散克塔的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. The Key of Orthanc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是巴拉多的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or perhaps the Keys of Barad-dur itself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还有七王之冠和五巫之杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along with the crowns of the seven kings and the rods of the Five Wizards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的阴谋已经害死无数人命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your treachery has already cost many lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,成千上万人正面临危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousands more are now at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你可以救他们，萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you could save them, Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾是敌人的心腹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were deep in the enemy's counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来打探军情的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you have come here for information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是可以透露一些消急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,中土世界有另一股力量在蕴酿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something festers in the heart of Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你并没有看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that you have failed to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是邪眼却看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Great Eye has seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他会掌握这个优势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now he presses his advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:13:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会发动进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His attack will come soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们全都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你早就知道了，对吧，甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know this, don't you, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会以为这个游侠会真的坐上刚铎王位吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot think that this Ranger will ever sit upon the throne of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个从阴影中爬出来的流亡者将永远不会成为人皇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This exile, crept from the shadows, will never be crowned king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫会毫不迟疑牺牲他最亲近的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf does not hesitate to sacrifice those closest to him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那些他声称热爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those he professes to love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我，你让那个半身人去送死之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, what words of comfort did you give the Halfling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说了什么好话？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you sent him to his doom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他走上一条必死无疑的不归路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The path that you have set him on can only lead to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我听够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他，一箭把他射死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him. Stick an arrow in his gob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼，只要你下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come down, Saruman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就饶你一命 - 你不用可怜或同情我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and your life will be spared. - Save your pity and your mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:14:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no use for it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手杖将被折断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your staff is broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,葛力马，你不必跟随他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grima, you need not follow him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前没像现在这么坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were not always as you are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经也是洛汗子弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were once a Man of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,下来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗子弟？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Man of Rohan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗子弟算什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the house of Rohan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不过是一群土匪住在茅草屋喝着肮脏的水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a thatched barn where brigands drink in the reek...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的小孩跟畜生在地上爬来爬去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their brats roll on the floor with the dogs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,圣盔谷的胜利不属于你骠骑国国王希优顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The victory at Helm's Deep does not belong to you, Theoden Horse-master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你愧对你的祖先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a lesser son of greater sires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,葛力马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grima...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,下来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱他，重获自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be free of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 自由？他永远不会自由 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Free? He will never be free. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down, cur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saruman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾是敌人的心腹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were deep in the enemy's counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我们你知道什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what you know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的护卫撤走，我就跟你说你会在哪里死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You withdraw your guard, and I will tell you where your doom will be decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要被关在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not be held prisoner here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把消息传给我们的盟友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send word to all our allies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,以及中土世界每个自由的角落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to every corner of Middle-earth that still stands free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人准备向我们进攻，我们要知道他的目标是哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy moves against us. We need to know where he will strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼的污秽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The filth of Saruman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,被冲得一干二净{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is washing away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,树木将回来住在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trees will come back to live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的树木{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狂野的树木 - 皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wild trees. - Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless my bark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,皮端格林图克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peregrin Took!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拿给我，小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that, my lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点交给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚让我们纪念为祖国壮烈牺牲的勇士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight we remember those who gave their blood to defend this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为死去的同胞干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail the victorious dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一口气喝下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pauses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不准洒出来 - 也不准吐出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No spills. - And no regurgitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在比酒量吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's a drinking game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个站着不倒的人赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last one standing wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为胜利干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'll we drink to? Let's drink to victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你感到高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am happy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个男子汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is an honorable man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都是男子汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are both honorable men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,率领洛汗人打胜仗的并不是我希优顿王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not Theoden of Rohan who led our people to victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必听我发牢骚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你还年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚属于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tonight is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人要跟全身长毛的矮小女人一起游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Dwarves that go swimming with little, hairy women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手有点麻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A slight tingle in my fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我喝醉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's affecting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他的酒量很差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't hold his liquor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他玩完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以在远方寻觅或是把酒喝到见底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you can search far and wide You can drink the whole town dry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你却找不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll never find a beer so brown But you'll never find a beer so brown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,比我们家乡更醇的啤酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the one we drink in our hometown As the one we drink in our hometown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以一杯接一杯狂饮上等麦酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can drink your fancy ales You can drink them by the flagon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是勇士喝的美酒…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the only brew for the brave and true{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但是勇士喝的美酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the only brew for the brave and true{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只有绿龙旅店才有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comes from The Green Dragon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家，我赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you! I win!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有佛罗多的消息？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No news of Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一点消息也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No word. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多越来越接近魔多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day, Frodo moves closer to Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么直觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does your heart tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Frodo is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,太冒险了，太冒险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too risky. Too risky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这些小偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从我们手上偷走它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stole it from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死他们，把他们两个都杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them. Kill them. Kill them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,安静，不能吵醒他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet! Mustn't wake them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就会前功尽弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mustn't ruin it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可是他们知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.48,0:23:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对我们起了疑心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They suspects us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么了，好兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it saying, my precious, my love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈是不是怕了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Smeagol losing his nerve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没有，我不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不怕呢，史麦戈痛恨臭哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never. Smeagol hates nasty Hobbitses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈要给他们死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol wants to see them dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会杀死他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:24:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈杀过人，可以再下毒手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol did it once. He can do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.00,0:24:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要得到宝贝，一定要把它抢回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must get the precious. We must get it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.04,0:24:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心点，你要有点耐心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience! Patience, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要先把他们带到她那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First we must lead them to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们走上弯曲阶梯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lead them to the Winding Stair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the stairs. And then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.88,0:24:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一直往上爬、往上爬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up, up, up, up, up the stairs we go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我们来到…那条隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we come to the tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when they go in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.16,0:24:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就永远出不来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no coming out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直都肚子饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's always hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.48,0:24:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她要填饱肚子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She always needs to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就一定要吃肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.44,0:24:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她只吃得到臭半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All she gets is filthy Orcses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,味道又臭又难吃，对吧，宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they doesn't taste very nice, does they, precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.92,0:25:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not very nice at all, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直想吃更甜美的肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She hungers for sweeter meats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哈比人的肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbit meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等她吃饱了，把骨头和衣服都吐出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when she throws away the bones and the empty clothes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就会找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then we will find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.04,0:25:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我要把它拿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take it for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.04,0:25:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对，我是说我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. We meant "for us."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咕鲁、咕鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gollum. Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只要小哈比人一死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The precious will be ours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.48,0:25:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝就属于我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once the Hobbitses are dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.52,0:25:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你这可恶的小坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You treacherous little toad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不！主人！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! Master!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.12,0:25:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,住手，山姆，别打他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sam! Leave him alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲耳听见他说要杀死我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard it from his own mouth. He means to murder us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:26:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有，史麦戈连苍蝇都不敢杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never! Smeagol wouldn't hurt a fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个又胖又丑的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a horrid, fat Hobbit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他讨厌史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who hates Smeagol...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.64,0:26:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才乱编谎话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who makes up nasty lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小坏蛋，我要把你搂扁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You miserable little maggot! I'll stove your head in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.64,0:26:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.32,0:26:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢说我骗人？你才在当面撒谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me a liar? You're a liar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把他吓跑我们就会迷路 - 我不管，我办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You scare him off, we're lost! - I don't care! I can't do it, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.68,0:26:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能坐着让他杀死我们 - 我不会把他赶走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't wait around for him to kill us! - I'm not sending him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't see it, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们光靠自己不行，没有人带路就到不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't do this by ourselves, Sam. Not without a guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你在我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you on my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.48,0:26:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在你身边，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on your side, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.32,0:26:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道，山姆，我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Sam. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你要相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.00,0:26:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.32,0:28:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是什么时辰？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有破晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我梦到我看见一道巨浪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dreamed I saw a great wave...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.72,0:28:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,淹没了绿色平原，大水一直冲到山坡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}climbing over green lands and above the hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.00,0:28:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我站在大水边缘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stood upon the brink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,脚底下是一片漆黑的无底洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was utterly dark in the abyss before my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.44,0:28:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我身后有一道亮光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A light shone behind me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我却无法回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I could not turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能站在那儿，等待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could only stand there, waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.36,0:28:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,人到了晚上就会胡思乱想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night changes many thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.44,0:28:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧，伊欧玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep, Eowyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.16,0:28:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,趁你还能睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快睡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,星光被阴影遮住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stars are veiled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.44,0:29:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,东方有什么在蠢蠢欲动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something stirs in the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一股永不歇息的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sleepless malice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人的邪眼在移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eye of the enemy is moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.28,0:29:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.24,0:30:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.88,0:30:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你发疯了吗？ - 我只想看一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, are you mad? - I just want to look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.72,0:30:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想再看一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.44,0:30:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.76,0:30:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.36,0:30:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.92,0:30:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.88,0:31:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊，甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Gandalf, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.36,0:31:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快救救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.64,0:31:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个蠢小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fool of a Took!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.32,0:31:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.48,0:32:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫，原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf, forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.80,0:32:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一棵树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.24,0:32:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有一棵白树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a white tree...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.28,0:32:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在石砌的庭院中央{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a courtyard of stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.56,0:32:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它枯死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.04,0:32:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,城市在燃烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city was burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.04,0:32:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯，你只看到这些？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minas Tirith? Is that what you saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我还看到…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.48,0:32:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.88,0:32:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到他的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could hear his voice in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what did you tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.88,0:32:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.88,0:32:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他问我是谁，我没回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked me my name. I didn't answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.24,0:32:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他伤害了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.84,0:32:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有提到佛罗多和魔戒？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you tell him about Frodo and the Ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.80,0:33:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得出皮聘没说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no lie in Pippin's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.12,0:33:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个蠢小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fool...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.52,0:33:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是个诚实的蠢小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but an honest fool he remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他没跟索伦提到佛罗多和魔戒的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told Sauron nothing of Frodo and the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.88,0:33:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们算是很幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been strangely fortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘在真知晶球上看到敌人的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin saw in the palantir a glimpse of the enemy's plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.20,0:33:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦打算攻击米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron moves to strike the city of Minas Tirith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他在圣盔谷的惨败让他知道一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His defeat at Helm's Deep showed our enemy one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.68,0:33:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,伊兰迪尔的继承人出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows the heir of Elendil has come forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,人类并没有他想的那么脆弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men are not as weak as he supposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.48,0:33:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,人类仍有勇气，也许有足够力量挑战他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is courage still, strength enough perhaps to challenge him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.48,0:33:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦害怕这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron fears this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能让中土世界的人民在同一个旗帜下奋勇作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not risk the peoples of Middle-earth uniting under one banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.04,0:33:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他打算摧毁米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will raze Minas Tirith to the ground...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.60,0:33:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止人类的王者再临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he sees a king return to the throne of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.28,0:33:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果刚铎点燃烽火，洛汗国必须准备参战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the beacons of Gondor are lit, Rohan must be ready for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.48,0:34:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没来帮助我们，凭什么要我们出兵救援？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why should we ride to the aid of those who did not come to ours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.16,0:34:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们欠刚铎什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we owe Gondor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去好了 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will go. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.36,0:34:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一定要警告他们 - 他们会受到警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They must be warned. - They will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你要从另一条路去那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must come to Minas Tirith by another road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,溯河而上，寻找黑色大船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow the river. Look to the black ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.56,0:34:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大战有如箭在弦上一触即发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are now in motion that cannot be undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.76,0:34:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ride for Minas Tirith...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会一个人去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I won't be going alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.52,0:34:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,皮端格林图克，你这个爱管闲事的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the inquisitive Hobbits, Peregrin Took, you are the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.16,0:34:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快！快！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.36,0:34:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要乱看咧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.36,0:34:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么每次都要乱看？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you always have to look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.28,0:35:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晓得，我忍不住 - 你每次都忍不住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. I can't help it. - You never can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.80,0:35:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.32,0:35:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我下次不敢了 - 你还不懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't do it again. - Don't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.00,0:35:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,魔王以为魔戒在你手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy thinks you have the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.12,0:35:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他会来找你，皮聘，他们一定要把你带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to be looking for you, Pip. They have to get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.28,0:35:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢？你会跟我来吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you? You're coming with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.16,0:35:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.76,0:35:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.56,0:35:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯有多远？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far is Minas Tirith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.08,0:35:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,骑马要骑三天，戒灵都用飞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days' ride, as the Nazgul flies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.88,0:35:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好祈祷他们不会追上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you better hope we don't have one of those on our tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.08,0:35:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,给你在路上抽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something for the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.44,0:35:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一包长底烟草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last of the Longbottom Leaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.56,0:35:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你抽完了，你抽得太凶了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you've run out. You smoke too much, Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.72,0:35:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可是，我们很快会再见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... But we'll see each other soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.56,0:35:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对吧？ - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Won't we? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.08,0:36:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道以后的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what's going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 梅里 - 快跑，影疾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Merry. - Run, Shadowfax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.16,0:36:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,用最快的速度狂奔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show us the meaning of haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.80,0:36:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.16,0:36:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.76,0:36:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,从小时候开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's always followed me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.92,0:36:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everywhere I went...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他都黏着我不放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since before we were tweens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是害他惹上各种麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would get him into the worst sort of trouble...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.36,0:36:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我也一定会替他解围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was always there to get him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他不在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.44,0:36:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟佛罗多和山姆一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like Frodo and Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我从哈比人身上学到一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing I have learned about Hobbits:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.92,0:36:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都很坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a most hardy folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.12,0:37:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候也很傻，他是图克家子弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foolhardy, maybe. He's a Took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.32,0:37:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,带她走最安全的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her by the safest road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.76,0:37:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有一艘船停靠在灰港岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ship lies anchored in the Grey Havens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.44,0:37:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等着载她到海外仙境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It waits to carry her across the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.48,0:37:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚玟安多米尔的最后之旅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last journey of Arwen Undomiel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.48,0:38:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你留下来什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing for you here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.08,0:38:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只有死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.56,0:38:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玟公主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Arwen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.80,0:38:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再耽误时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we cannot delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,公主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.80,0:39:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我你看到什么？ - 亚玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me what you have seen. - Arwen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.60,0:39:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你有预知的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the gift of foresight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.16,0:39:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你的未来有死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked into your future, and I saw death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.04,0:39:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是也有新生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is also life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个小孩，那是我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw there was a child. You saw my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.76,0:39:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个未来可能无法成真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That future is almost gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.44,0:39:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是仍有希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is not lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.04,0:39:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只确定一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things are certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.48,0:39:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我现在离开他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I leave him now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.48,0:39:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会终生悔恨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will regret it forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.20,0:40:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.76,0:40:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,火花将从死灰中复燃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the ashes a fire shall be woken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.76,0:40:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,光明将从阴影中再现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A light from the shadow shall spring{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.32,0:40:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,断裂的圣剑将重新接上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renewed shall be blade that was broken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.00,0:40:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,失去王冠者将成为人皇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crownless again shall be king{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.96,0:40:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,请你重铸圣剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Re-forge the sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.88,0:41:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手好冰冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hands are cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.96,0:41:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你已失去精灵的永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The life of the Eldar is leaving you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.52,0:41:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was my choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.28,0:41:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你答不答应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether by your will or not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.92,0:41:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不会搭船离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no ship now that can bear me hence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.40,0:42:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚越过刚铎边界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just passed into the realm of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.88,0:42:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minas Tirith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.72,0:42:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,众王之城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}City of kings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.48,0:43:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.44,0:43:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那棵树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.44,0:43:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫、甘道夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf. Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.28,0:43:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是刚铎的圣白树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the White Tree of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.72,0:43:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,王者之树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tree of the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.72,0:43:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是迪耐瑟并不是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Denethor, however, is not king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是刚铎的宰相和摄政王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a steward only, a caretaker of the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.96,0:44:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,给我听好了，迪耐瑟大人是波罗莫的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now listen carefully. Lord Denethor is Boromir's father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.04,0:44:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好别让他知道他爱子的死讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To give him news of his beloved son's death would be most unwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.32,0:44:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也别提起佛罗多和魔戒的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do not mention Frodo or the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.64,0:44:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,更别提到亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And say nothing of Aragorn either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.24,0:44:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好一句话都不要说，皮端格林图克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, it's better if you don't speak at all, Peregrin Took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.28,0:44:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耐瑟大人，爱克西里昂之子，刚铎的宰相和摄政王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail Denethor, son of Ecthelion, lord and steward of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.28,0:45:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我在黑暗的时刻前来提供我的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come with tidings in this dark hour, and with counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.96,0:45:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你能给我一个交代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you come to explain this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.96,0:45:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你是来告诉我我儿子的死因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you come to tell me why my son is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫是为了救我们而死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir died to save us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.16,0:45:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟我的同胞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my kinsman and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.00,0:45:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他为了保护我们壮烈牺牲 - 皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He fell defending us from many foes. - Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.00,0:45:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为了回报他的救命之恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer you my service, such as it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.00,0:45:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意效忠于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in payment of this debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.16,0:45:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此我要问你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my first command to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.20,0:46:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么能逃走，而我儿子武艺这么高强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you escape and my son did not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.00,0:46:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,却不能活着逃出来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so mighty a man as he was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.00,0:46:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,强者只要中一箭就会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mightiest man may be slain by one arrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.60,0:46:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,况且波罗莫身中了好几箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Boromir was pierced by many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.64,0:46:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.52,0:46:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大人，请你以后再为波罗莫哀悼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, there will be a time to grieve for Boromir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.60,0:46:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在并不是时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it is not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.08,0:46:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大战即将展开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.60,0:46:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,敌军已经逼近边界，你身为刚铎宰相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy is on your doorstep. As steward, you are charged...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,必须捍卫这座城市，刚铎的大军在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the defense of this city. Where are Gondor's armies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.56,0:46:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你仍然有盟友，并不会孤军奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still have friends. You are not alone in this fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.60,0:46:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,向洛汗国的希优顿王求救，点燃烽火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send word to Theoden of Rohan. Light the beacons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.68,0:46:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你自以为很聪明，米斯兰达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you are wise, Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.40,0:46:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你却低估了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet for all your subtleties, you have not wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.56,0:47:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我是瞎了眼睛吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think the eyes of the White Tower are blind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.92,0:47:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的比你想像的多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have seen more than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.16,0:47:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你一方面想利用我对抗魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your left hand you would use me as a shield against Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,另一方面想趁机推翻我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with your right you'd seek to supplant me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.56,0:47:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道谁在协助希优顿王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who rides with Theoden of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.44,0:47:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，我早就听过亚拉冈了，他是亚拉松之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Word has reached my ears of this Aragorn, son of Arathorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.60,0:47:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉你，我才不会向北方游侠屈服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I tell you now, I will not bow to this Ranger from the North...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.60,0:47:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是失去王位的落魄王族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}last of a ragged house long bereft of lordship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.28,0:47:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有权利拒绝人皇回归，宰相大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authority is not given to you to deny the return of the king, steward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.28,0:47:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我没有人能统治刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rule of Gondor is mine and no other's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.88,0:47:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.60,0:47:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在眼里只有权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All has turned to vain ambition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.32,0:48:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他甚至会用哀伤掩饰他的野心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would even use his grief as a cloak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这座王都屹立了一千年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand years this city has stood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.56,0:48:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它将毁于一个疯子的手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, at the whim of a madman, it will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.20,0:48:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而圣白树，王者之树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the White Tree, the tree of the king...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.56,0:48:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,将永远不会开花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will never bloom again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.28,0:48:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么还在守着它？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are they still guarding it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.95,0:48:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们仍抱有一线希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They guard it because they have hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.80,0:48:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小小的希望有一天会开花结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A faint and fading hope that one day it will flower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.16,0:48:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,人皇将回归，王都也将恢复昔日光辉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That a king will come and this city will be as it once was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.08,0:48:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不会遭到毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before it fell into decay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.16,0:48:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,西方孕育的智慧早被遗忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old wisdom borne out of the West was forsaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.56,0:48:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,历任国王盖的墓陵远比王宫还要奢华{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kings made tombs more splendid than the houses of the living...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.08,0:48:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只会缅怀先祖的丰功伟业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and counted the old names of their descent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.16,0:48:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,却对自己的儿子不屑一顾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dearer than the names of their sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.12,0:48:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,后继无人的城主坐在古老的宫殿墨守成规{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Childless lords sat in aged halls, musing on heraldry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.36,0:48:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,或是登上冰冷的高塔求神问运、占星卜卦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or in high, cold towers, asking questions of the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.84,0:48:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因此刚铎人民命运堪虞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so the people of Gondor fell into ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.60,0:49:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,王室香火无以为继{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The line of kings failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.64,0:49:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,圣白树也枯萎凋零{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Tree withered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.72,0:49:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎将落入敌人手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rule of Gondor was given over to lesser men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.64,0:49:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.36,0:49:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，它就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, there it lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.88,0:49:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市长久以来都笼罩在它的阴影之下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This city has dwelt ever in the sight of its shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.24,0:49:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雨即将来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A storm is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.56,0:49:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这并不是自然的现象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the weather of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.64,0:49:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而是索伦一手造成的异象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a device of Sauron's making.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.00,0:49:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是他大举进攻的前兆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A broil of fume he sends ahead of his host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.36,0:49:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多的半兽人不能忍受阳光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Orcs of Mordor have no love of daylight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.00,0:49:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他就将太阳遮蔽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he covers the face of the sun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.00,0:49:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好让他们踏上征途{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ease their passage along the road to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当魔多的魔影到达这座城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Shadow of Mordor reaches this city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.92,0:49:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,大战就会展开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.28,0:50:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.24,0:50:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minas Tirith...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.52,0:50:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是令人叹为观止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.08,0:50:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还要去哪儿？ - 现在要走太迟了，皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So where are we off to next? - Oh, it's too late for that, Peregrin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.88,0:50:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法离开这座城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no leaving this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.44,0:50:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,救兵一定要赶来支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help must come to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.16,0:50:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,下午茶时间一定快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be getting near teatime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.96,0:50:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在好一点的地方，就一定会有下午茶时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leastways, it would be in decent places where there is still teatime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.84,0:50:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是在一个好地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not in decent places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.00,0:50:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.28,0:50:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.96,0:50:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一种预感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.76,0:50:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我回不了家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I'll be coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.44,0:50:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你回得了家，你一定会回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you will. Of course you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.60,0:51:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你别瞎想了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just morbid thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.92,0:51:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会去而复返{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going there and back again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.56,0:51:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟比尔博一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like Mr. Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.80,0:51:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你等着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.12,0:51:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这些土地曾经是刚铎王国的一部份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think these lands were once part of the kingdom of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在很久以前，还有国王的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long ago, when there was a king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.80,0:51:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.28,0:51:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,国王头上又有王冠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king has got a crown again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.16,0:52:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快来啊，哈比人，不要停下来，往这儿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Hobbits! Mustn't stop now. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.28,0:52:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜我只是挂名的卫兵吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I imagine this is just a ceremonial position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.48,0:52:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我不必真的上战场吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, they don't actually expect me to do any fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不对？ - 你已经对宰相宣誓效忠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do they? - You're in the service of the steward now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.00,0:52:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须奉命行事，皮端格林图克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to do as you're told, Peregrin Took.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.40,0:52:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,傻哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ridiculous Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎卫兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard of the Citadel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.80,0:53:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.04,0:53:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天上没有星星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no more stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.76,0:53:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,时候到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.52,0:53:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好安静哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.20,0:53:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是暴风雨前的宁静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the deep breath before the plunge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.64,0:53:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不想上战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be in a battle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.32,0:53:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是等待一场不可避免的大战更令人害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but waiting on the edge of one I can't escape is even worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.84,0:53:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫，佛罗多和山姆有成功的希望吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any hope, Gandalf, for Frodo and Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.80,0:53:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的希望并不大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There never was much hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.88,0:53:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一线希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a fool's hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.52,0:54:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人已蓄势待发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our enemy is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.48,0:54:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他集结了强大兵力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His full strength's gathered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.32,0:54:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是半兽人，还有人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only Orcs, but Men as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,来自南方的哈拉德林人部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legions of Haradrim from the south...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.20,0:54:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,以及来自海岸的佣兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mercenaries from the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.08,0:54:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,全都听从魔多的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All will answer Mordor's call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.84,0:54:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.52,0:54:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎将难逃灭亡的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be the end of Gondor as we know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.00,0:54:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人会对这里展开猛烈攻势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here the hammer stroke will fall hardest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.36,0:54:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果安都因河被占领，奥斯吉力亚斯碉堡被攻陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the river is taken, if the garrison at Osgiliath falls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.84,0:54:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市的最后防线就会瓦解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last defense of this city will be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.68,0:54:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你这个白袍巫师，你一定会有办法的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have the White Wizard. That's got to count for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.64,0:54:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧，甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.92,0:54:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦还没派出最厉害的手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron has yet to reveal his deadliest servant...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.04,0:55:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他将率领魔多大军进行攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one who will lead Mordor's armies in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.04,0:55:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,据说没有活人杀得了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one they say no living man can kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.24,0:55:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,安格马的巫王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Witch King of Angmar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.48,0:55:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've met him before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.52,0:55:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他在风云顶刺了佛罗多一剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stabbed Frodo on Weathertop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.64,0:55:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是戒灵之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the lord of the Nazgul...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.84,0:55:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,九骑士之首{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the greatest of the Nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.44,0:55:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他的巢穴是米那斯魔窟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minas Morgul is his lair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.56,0:55:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,死城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dead City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.24,0:55:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很可怕的地方，到处都是敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nasty place. Full of enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.68,0:55:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，快呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick. Quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.04,0:56:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会看到我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will see. They will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别过去，别过去，瞧，我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come away. Come away. Look, we have found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.76,0:56:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,通往魔多的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way into Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.80,0:56:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密阶梯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret stair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.24,0:56:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,往上爬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.20,0:56:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不，佛罗多 - 不是那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, Mr. Frodo! - Not that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.80,0:56:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在干嘛？ - 别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's it doing? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.84,0:57:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 戒灵在召唤我 - 糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're calling me. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.56,0:57:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快躲起来，躲起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide! Hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.08,0:58:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我成觉得到他的剑锋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel his blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.60,0:58:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,决战时刻终于来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We come to it at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.56,0:58:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒圣战即将展开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great battle of our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.60,0:59:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，小哈比人，我们一定要爬上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come away, Hobbits. We climb. We must climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.72,0:59:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,棋盘已经摆好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The board is set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.92,0:59:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,棋子闲始移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pieces are moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.00,0:59:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上去，爬上阶梯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up, up, up the stairs we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.84,0:59:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就进入隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then it's into the tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.68,0:59:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个隧道里头有什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's in this tunnel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.40,0:59:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说，你给我听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You listen to me, and you listen good and proper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.32,0:59:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他出事你说会倒大楣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything happens to him, you have me to answer to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.44,0:59:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要开到什么不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One sniff something's not right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.16,0:59:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我背上的汗毛竖起来，你就玩完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one hair stands up on the back of my head, it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.56,1:00:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要宰了你这臭东西，你休想有好日子过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more slinker. No more stinker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.56,1:00:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你死定了，懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gone. Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.08,1:00:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我在看着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.40,1:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才跟他说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.56,1:00:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么，只是交代一些事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Just clearing something up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.64,1:00:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘，你要完成一项任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peregrin Took, my lad, there is a task now to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.68,1:00:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让你这哈比人有机会再一次证明自己的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another opportunity for one of the Shire-folk to prove their great worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.08,1:00:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对不能失败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not fail me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.92,1:01:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人在对岸没有任何动静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been very quiet across the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.16,1:01:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人躲起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Orcs are lying low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.68,1:01:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很可能已经撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The garrison may have moved out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.80,1:01:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们派了探子到凯尔安卓斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've sent scouts to Cair Andros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.68,1:01:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果半兽人从北边进攻，我们一定会有预警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Orcs attack from the north, we'll have some warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.28,1:01:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.60,1:02:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要十个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need 10 more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.88,1:02:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.72,1:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不是从北边进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not coming from the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.56,1:02:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快赶到河边，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the river. Quick. Quick. Go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.36,1:02:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,划快一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.08,1:03:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,拔剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.00,1:04:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,挡住他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold! Hold them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.88,1:05:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.32,1:05:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,阿蒙丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amon Din{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.52,1:05:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,阿蒙丁的烽火点燃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beacon. The beacon of Amon Din is lit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.84,1:05:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,终于燃起一线希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope is kindled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.44,1:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯的烽火，烽火点燃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beacons of Minas Tirith! The beacons are lit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.00,1:07:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎向我们求救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gondor calls for aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.16,1:07:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国将前往支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Rohan will answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.48,1:07:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗国全军集结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Muster the Rohirrim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.36,1:08:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,召集登哈洛大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assemble the army at Dunharrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.52,1:08:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量召集人马，我给你两天时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As many men as can be found. You have two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.04,1:08:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,第三天就整装出发，前往刚铎展开大战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the third, we ride for Gondor and war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.32,1:08:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 前进 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forward. - Very good, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加姆林 - 王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gamling. - My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.32,1:08:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,全速跨越洛汗平原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make haste across the Riddermark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.08,1:08:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,召集人马前往登哈洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Summon every able-bodied man to Dunharrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.36,1:08:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.04,1:08:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你跟我们一起去吗？ - 我最远只能跟到营地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you ride with us? - Just to the encampment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.36,1:08:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,按照传统，王女必须为士兵送行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tradition for the women of the court to farewell the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.84,1:08:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,人民找到他们的领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men have found their captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.92,1:08:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们愿意跟随你作战，甚至愿意壮烈牺牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will follow you into battle, even to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.44,1:08:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了我们希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have given us hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.20,1:09:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.52,1:09:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一把剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.32,1:09:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请你让我参战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.80,1:09:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意为你效忠，希优顿王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer you my service, Theoden King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.72,1:09:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And gladly I accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.92,1:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我封你为洛汗骑士梅里雅达克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall be Meriadoc, esquire of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.88,1:09:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,骠骑勇士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horse-Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.76,1:09:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望能召集矮人大军，披上盔甲和你们并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could muster a legion of Dwarves, fully armed and filthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.76,1:09:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你的族人不需要参战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your kinsmen may have no need to ride to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.88,1:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,战争就已经找上门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear war already marches on their own lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.76,1:10:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,米那斯提力斯的攻城战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it is before the walls of Minas Tirith...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.40,1:10:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,将决定人类是否将会灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the doom of our time will be decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.88,1:10:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是决战时刻，洛汗骑士，你们曾誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now is the hour. Riders of Rohan, oaths you have taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.60,1:10:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该行动了，为吾王及国土作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, fulfill them all. To lord and land!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.48,1:11:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抵挡不了，城市已经沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't hold them. The city is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.76,1:11:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,下令撤退，我们退回米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the men to break cover. We ride for Minas Tirith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.60,1:11:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,戒灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nazgul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.24,1:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快找掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.88,1:11:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,戒灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nazgul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,彻退，退回米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back. Fall back to Minas Tirith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.84,1:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.76,1:12:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 撤退！撤退！ - 快逃命吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Retreat! Retreat! - Run for your lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.60,1:12:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的时代结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The age of Men is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.08,1:12:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人的时代来临了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time of the Orc has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.12,1:12:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 向前跑 - 是戒灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep going. - It's the Nazgul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.08,1:12:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大人，快找掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover, my lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.72,1:12:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.60,1:12:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是米斯兰达 - 白袍骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Mithrandir. - The White Rider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.96,1:13:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,打开城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.04,1:13:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,米斯兰达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.64,1:13:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们攻破我们的防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They broke through our defenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.56,1:14:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,占领了桥梁和西岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken the bridge and the west bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.84,1:14:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 兽人大军正越河而来 - 迪耐瑟大人早就料到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Battalions of Orcs are crossing the river. - It is as the Lord Denethor predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.20,1:14:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他早就预知有这种结局 - 他却什么也不做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Long has he foreseen this doom. - Foreseen and done nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.12,1:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.44,1:14:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你第一次见到半身人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the first Halfling to have crossed your path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.44,1:14:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.00,1:14:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你见到佛罗多和山姆？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen Frodo and Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.44,1:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？几时？ - 在伊西力安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? When? - In Ithilien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不到两天前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.56,1:14:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们往魔窟谷的方向前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf, they're taking the road to the Morgul Vale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.72,1:14:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后会通过西力斯昂哥隘口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the pass of Cirith Ungol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.56,1:14:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.12,1:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 法拉墨，把一切经过告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong? - Faramir, tell me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.20,1:14:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,把你知道的都告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me all you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.40,1:14:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是这样效忠王都吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how you would serve your city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.00,1:15:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你要让它遭到毁灭？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would risk its utter ruin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.32,1:15:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我以我的判断做出正确决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what I judged to be right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.64,1:15:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你判断的正确决定？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you judged to be right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.24,1:15:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你把手持权力之戒的半身人送进魔多的魔掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent the Ring of Power into Mordor in the hands of a witless Halfling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.08,1:15:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该把魔戒带回来，放在安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should have been brought back to the Citadel to be kept safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,藏起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.52,1:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,锁在严密的保险库里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dark and deep in the vaults...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.44,1:15:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能使用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to be used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.80,1:15:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,除非在最危急的时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless at the uttermost end of need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.12,1:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会使用魔戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not use the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.32,1:15:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就算米那斯提力斯沦陷，只剩下我一人能捍卫它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if Minas Tirith were falling in ruin and I alone could save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.76,1:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直想效法古代的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever you desire to appear lordly and gracious...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.76,1:15:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,像他们一样大公无私{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a king of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.80,1:16:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫就会记得他父亲的需求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir would have remembered his father's need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.96,1:16:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会把那个贵重的礼物带来给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have brought me a kingly gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.64,1:16:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫才不会把魔戒带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir would not have brought the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.60,1:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他会伸出手抢走魔戒，沦为魔王的爪牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have stretched out his hand to this thing and taken it. He would've fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.88,1:16:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么也不懂 - 他会把魔戒占为己有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know nothing of this matter! - He would have kept it for his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.04,1:16:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,然后当他回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when he returned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.32,1:16:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对认不出自己的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would not have known your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.16,1:16:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫对我忠心耿耿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir was loyal to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.88,1:16:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是巫师的徒弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not some wizard's pupil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.60,1:16:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.60,1:16:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.76,1:17:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.72,1:17:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点，主人，小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, master. Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.60,1:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这座山谷很深{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very far to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.00,1:18:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这些阶梯很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very dangerous are the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.60,1:18:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.92,1:18:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,到史麦戈这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.44,1:18:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.96,1:18:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.68,1:18:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.00,1:18:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么这么痛恨可怜的史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he hates poor Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.00,1:18:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈到底对他做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has Smeagol ever done to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.88,1:18:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,主人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.04,1:18:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,主人身上的担子好沉重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master carries heavy burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.68,1:18:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈知道，好沉重的担子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol knows. Heavy, heavy burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.28,1:18:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小胖子不会懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fat one cannot know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.56,1:19:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈会照顾主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol look after master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.52,1:19:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.92,1:19:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要它，我从他的眼神看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs it. Smeagol sees it in his eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.60,1:19:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他很快就会向你要，你等着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very soon he will ask you for it. You will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.24,1:19:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小胖子会把它从你手中抢过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fat one will take it from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,派出所有军队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send forth all legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.84,1:19:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,全力进攻直到把城市攻陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not stop the attack until the city is taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.60,1:19:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们赶尽杀绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slay them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.40,1:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巫师呢？ - 我会对付他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What of the wizard? - I will break him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.52,1:19:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿王的骠骑呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are Theoden's riders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.12,1:19:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗大军会来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Rohan's army come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.88,1:19:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,米斯兰达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.16,1:20:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最犀利的武器就是勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courage is the best defense that you have now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.84,1:20:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在想什么，皮端格林图克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you thinking, Peregrin Took?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.64,1:20:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这个小哈比人能为伟大的城主做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What service can a Hobbit offer such a great lord of Men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.52,1:20:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经做得很好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was well-done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.20,1:20:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这种慷慨激昂的行为不该受到冰冷的劝阻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A generous deed should not be checked with cold counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.00,1:20:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要加入要塞卫戍部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are to join the tower guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.08,1:20:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为他们找不到我适合穿的军服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think they would find any livery that would fit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.24,1:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这身军服曾经属于一个少年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once belonged to a young boy of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.88,1:20:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一个很愚蠢的少年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very foolish one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.60,1:20:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他浪费太多时间屠龙，没有乖乖学习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who wasted many hours slaying dragons instead of attending to his studies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.00,1:20:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你的吗？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This was yours? - Yes, it was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.92,1:20:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我父亲替我缝制的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father had it made for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.76,1:20:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.28,1:20:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你当时还要高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taller than you were then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.44,1:20:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我不会再长高了，只会长胖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I'm not likely to grow anymore, except sideways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.72,1:20:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我穿军服也不太适合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never fitted me either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.92,1:21:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,波罗莫比较像一个军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boromir was always the soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.76,1:21:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟我父亲其实很像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were so alike, he and my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.28,1:21:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,心高气傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.08,1:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都很固执{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stubborn even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.04,1:21:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是却很坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.04,1:21:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你拥有不同的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you have strength of a different kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.84,1:21:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天你父亲会了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one day your father will see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.48,1:21:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我在此宣誓效忠刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here do I swear fealty and service to Gondor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.44,1:21:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不管和平或战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in peace or war...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.56,1:21:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,置生死于度外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in living or dying...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.40,1:21:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,从…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.32,1:21:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From this hour henceforth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.28,1:21:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,直到大人解除我的誓言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until my lord release me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.68,1:21:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或是直到我死为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or death take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.48,1:21:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会忘记你的誓言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I shall not forget it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.16,1:21:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也一定会回应你的效忠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor fail to reward that which is given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.12,1:22:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,以爱回应忠诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fealty with love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.52,1:22:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,以荣誉回应英勇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valor with honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.76,1:22:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,以后仇回应背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disloyalty with vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.72,1:22:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该轻易放弃边界防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think we should so lightly abandon the outer defenses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.00,1:22:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你兄长一直坚守的防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}defenses that your brother long held intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.92,1:22:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么做？ - 我们不能说这样弃守…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What would you have me do? - I will not yield...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.56,1:22:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,帕兰诺平原和安都因河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the river in Pelennor unfought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.52,1:22:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要夺回奥斯吉力亚斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Osgiliath must be retaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.36,1:22:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯吉力亚斯已经被攻陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, Osgiliath is overrun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.08,1:22:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,打仗一定有风险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much must be risked in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.52,1:22:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有哪位将军有勇气为摄政王效命？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a captain here who still has the courage to do his lord's will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.68,1:22:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我跟哥哥交换命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish now that our places had been exchanged...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.88,1:23:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你宁愿我死，让波罗莫活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I had died and Boromir had lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.16,1:23:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.56,1:23:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你失去了波罗莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you were robbed of Boromir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.48,1:23:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我就代替他执行这项任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do what I can in his stead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.60,1:23:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能生还，请你肯定我的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I should return, think better of me, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.16,1:23:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这要看你是不是能凯旋归来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will depend on the manner of your return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.08,1:25:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.56,1:25:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你想偷溜，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaking off, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.52,1:25:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,偷溜？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.36,1:25:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,偷溜？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.96,1:25:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小胖子真有良心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fat Hobbit is always so polite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.28,1:25:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈带他们找到没有人找得到的秘密通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol shows them secret ways that nobody else could find...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.52,1:25:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他却说我想偷溜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they say "sneak."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.32,1:25:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,偷溜？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.56,1:25:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个好朋友，是啊，你真是个好兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice friend. Oh, yes, my precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.44,1:25:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好兄弟 - 够了，够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very nice, very nice. - All right. All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.32,1:25:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是被你吓了一跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just startled me is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.00,1:25:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你冈J才在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.48,1:25:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,偷溜呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sneaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.96,1:25:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，随便你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. Have it your own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.32,1:25:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉把你吵醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to wake you, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.20,1:25:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得出发了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to be moving on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.32,1:26:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天色还是很暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dark still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.08,1:26:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天色一直都很暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always dark here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.56,1:26:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.68,1:26:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 精灵干粮不见了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Elven bread. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.72,1:26:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只剩下那点干粮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all we have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.28,1:26:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他拿走了，一定是他偷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took it. He must have!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.28,1:26:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我？可怜的史麦戈才没拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol? No, no, not poor Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.68,1:26:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈最讨厌吃精灵干粮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol hates nasty Elf bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.76,1:26:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗人，你拿到哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a lying rat! What did you do with it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.12,1:26:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他不吃那玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.64,1:26:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能是他拿的 - 瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He can't have taken it. - Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.04,1:26:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.52,1:26:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他的外套上有干粮屑，是他拿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crumbs on his jacketses. He took it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.60,1:26:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是他偷走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.08,1:26:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到他老是趁主人不注意偷吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seen him. He's always stuffing his face when master's not looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.48,1:27:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a filthy lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.44,1:27:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个狡猾的小坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stinking, two-faced sneak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.80,1:27:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 你敢说是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam! - Call me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.20,1:27:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.48,1:27:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.96,1:27:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要宰了他 - 山姆，不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll kill him! - Sam! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.64,1:27:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，我不是故意的，我只是…气炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my... I'm sorry. I didn't mean it to go so far. I was just so... So angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.36,1:27:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来，休息一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, just... Let's just rest a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.64,1:27:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很好 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm all right. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.92,1:27:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不好，你累坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not all right. You're exhausted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.16,1:27:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,都是咕鲁害的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's that Gollum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.44,1:27:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方有鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.32,1:27:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴的魔戒太沉重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's that thing around your neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.40,1:27:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could help a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.88,1:27:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以替你戴一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could carry it for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.72,1:27:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我替你戴一阵子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry it for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.64,1:27:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以替你戴一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could carry it... I could carry it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.52,1:27:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,减轻你的负担{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share the load... Share the load... the load... the load.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.16,1:27:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.52,1:27:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不想要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.68,1:27:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.72,1:28:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧、瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.52,1:28:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他想把它占为己有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants it for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.12,1:28:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.36,1:28:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快滚，给我走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away! Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.36,1:28:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.36,1:28:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你才该走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.84,1:28:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.20,1:28:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's a liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.76,1:28:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他在挑拨我们的成情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's poisoned you against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.84,1:28:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你再也帮不了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't help me anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.72,1:28:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的真心话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.12,1:28:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.92,1:30:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.32,1:30:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲完全失去理智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's will has turned to madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.52,1:30:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不要白白去送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not throw away your life so rashly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须誓死效忠刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does my allegiance lie if not here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.28,1:30:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是努曼诺尔人的圣城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the city of the Men of Numenor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.84,1:30:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,为了捍卫这座美丽的圣城，它辉煌的过去和智慧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will gladly give my life to defend her beauty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.80,1:30:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意牺牲我的性命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her memory, her wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.36,1:30:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲很爱你，法拉墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father loves you, Faramir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.52,1:30:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他最后会明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will remember it before the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.12,1:31:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你会唱歌吗，小哈比人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you sing, Master Hobbit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.56,1:31:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.60,1:31:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,会啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.92,1:31:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的同胞觉得我唱得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, well enough for my own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.32,1:31:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们唱的歌谣都很粗俗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have no songs for great halls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.76,1:32:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不能登大雅之堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and evil times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.84,1:32:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不能登大雅之堂？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why should your songs be unfit for my halls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.80,1:32:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，唱一首来听听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, sing me a song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.28,1:32:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,家园在后方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home is behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.80,1:32:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,世界在前方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world ahead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.96,1:32:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,路途多遥远、千辛又万苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there are many paths to tread{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.60,1:32:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过幽暗阴影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through shadow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.32,1:32:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迎向黑夜边缘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the edge of night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.16,1:32:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,直到夜空繁星闪烁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until the stars are all alight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.24,1:32:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,迷雾和阴影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mist and shadow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.76,1:33:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,乌云和黑暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cloud and shade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.40,1:33:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,全都消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All shall fade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.12,1:33:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,全都消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All shall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.88,1:33:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,消散一空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.68,1:33:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,前进！前进！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}March! March!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.80,1:33:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,前进！前进！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}March! March!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.96,1:34:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,国王来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way for the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.80,1:34:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.28,1:34:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,国王来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.28,1:34:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.16,1:34:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,吾王万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail to you, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.56,1:34:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,葛林伯，有多少人马？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grimbold, how many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.96,1:34:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我从西谷带来五百人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bring 500 men from the Westfold, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.36,1:34:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,沼境来了三百人，希优顿王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have 300 more from Fenmarch, Theoden King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.16,1:34:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雪界河来了多少骑士？ - 个也没有，王上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are the riders from Snowborn? - None have come, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.20,1:34:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,六千名长矛手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six thousand spears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.36,1:34:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,比我预期的少一半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Less than half of what I'd hoped for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.64,1:34:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,六千人不能突破魔多大军防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six thousand will not be enough to break the lines of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.76,1:35:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,会有更多人马来到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.92,1:35:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,时间拖久了刚铎就会沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every hour lost hastens Gondor's defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.04,1:35:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只能等到天亮，然后就要出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have till dawn, then we must ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.08,1:35:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,战，马焦躁不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The horses are restless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.60,1:35:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,战士却寂静无声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the men are quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.56,1:35:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们紧张得说不出话来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They grow nervous in the shadow of the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.16,1:35:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那条路…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That road there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.96,1:35:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,…通往哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where does that lead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.76,1:35:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那里是丁祸，黑暗之门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the road to the Dimholt, the door under the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.32,1:35:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人进去能活着出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None who venture there ever return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.52,1:35:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是亡灵之山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That mountain is evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.36,1:36:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.92,1:36:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去找吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find some food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.32,1:36:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.72,1:36:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是洛汗骠骑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A true esquire of Rohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.36,1:36:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.92,1:36:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.40,1:36:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这把剑并不锐利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't all that dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.16,1:36:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,它其实挺钝的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not even sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.16,1:37:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不行，用钝剑可杀不了半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's no good. You won't kill many Orcs with a blunt blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.72,1:37:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.40,1:37:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去找铁匠磨剑，去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the smithy. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.36,1:37:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该怂恿他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should not encourage him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.08,1:37:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该对他没信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should not doubt him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.72,1:37:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他很有勇气，只是个子太小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not doubt his heart, only the reach of his arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.72,1:37:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里为什么不能上战场？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should Merry be left behind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.48,1:37:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟你一样有参战的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has as much cause to go to war as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.24,1:37:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么就不能为他所爱的人奋战？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can he not fight for those he loves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.68,1:37:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你对战争的了解跟那个哈比人一样少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know as little of war as that Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.92,1:37:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,当他心中充满恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the fear takes him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.20,1:37:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,当他看到士兵在战场上全身血淋淋地惨叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the blood and the screams and the horror of battle take hold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.60,1:37:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为他还会奋勇作战吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you think he would stand and fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.32,1:37:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会逃之天夭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would flee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.12,1:37:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他这么做并没有错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he would be right to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.36,1:38:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,人类是逼不得已才会作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War is the province of Men, Eowyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.00,1:38:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我选择了凡人的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I choose a mortal life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.64,1:38:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望能见到他…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could've seen him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.64,1:38:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,…最后一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.52,1:39:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.76,1:39:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿王找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Theoden awaits you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.12,1:39:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take my leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.72,1:39:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,爱隆王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord Elrond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.56,1:39:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了挚爱的女儿而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come on behalf of one whom I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.16,1:39:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玟就快死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arwen is dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.96,1:40:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,她无法抵抗魔多的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She will not long survive the evil that now spreads from Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.76,1:40:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,暮星的光芒越来越微弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The light of the Evenstar is failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.28,1:40:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦的力量日益强大，她就逐渐失去生命力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Sauron's power grows, her strength wanes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.48,1:40:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,亚玟的生命和魔戒的命运息息相关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arwen's life is now tied to the fate of the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.96,1:40:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,魔影即将笼罩我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Shadow is upon us, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.92,1:40:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,世界末日即将来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.96,1:40:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这将是魔王的末日，不是人类的终结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will not be our end, but his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.36,1:40:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们绝对无法获得胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ride to war, but not to victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.96,1:40:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦的邪恶大军正向米那斯提力斯前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron's armies march on Minas Tirith, this you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.76,1:40:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他另外又派一支军队从河面展开攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in secret he sends another force which will attack from the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.64,1:40:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他派昂巴海盗船从南方进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fleet of Corsair ships sails from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.72,1:40:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,两天后就会攻到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be in the city in two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.28,1:40:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们寡不敌众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're outnumbered, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.84,1:40:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要搬更多救兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need more men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.32,1:40:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有救兵可搬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.84,1:40:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,亡灵之山住了一些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are those who dwell in the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.76,1:41:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.12,1:41:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,叛徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}traitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.00,1:41:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我找他们帮忙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would call upon them to fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.32,1:41:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们什么都不相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They believe in nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.08,1:41:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,也不听任何人的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They answer to no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.36,1:41:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会听刚铎人皇的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will answer to the king of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.60,1:41:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,安都瑞尔，西方之炎用纳希尔圣剑碎月重铸而成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anduril, the Flame of the West, forged from the shards of Narsil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.04,1:41:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦绝对不会忘记伊兰迪尔圣剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron will not have forgotten the Sword of Elendil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.48,1:42:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经破碎的圣剑将再度回到米那斯提力斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blade that was broken shall return to Minas Tirith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.40,1:42:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能驾驭这把圣剑的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who can wield the power of this sword...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.00,1:42:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,将召集史上最强大的军队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can summon to him an army more deadly than any that walks this earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.72,1:42:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把游侠的身份放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put aside the Ranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.04,1:42:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,成为你命中注定该当的人皇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Become who you were born to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.56,1:42:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,往丁祸走上亡者之道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the Dimholt road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.56,1:42:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我给人类希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give hope to Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.60,1:42:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是为了自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep none for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.60,1:42:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要走？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.72,1:43:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大战即将在西方展开，你不能临阵脱逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war lies to the east. You cannot leave on the eve of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.36,1:43:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能抛弃这些弟兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot abandon the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.72,1:43:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eowyn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.48,1:43:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.80,1:43:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么跟来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why have you come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.36,1:43:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.60,1:43:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你爱的只是一个理想、一个幻影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is but a shadow and a thought that you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.56,1:43:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能回报你的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot give you what you seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.48,1:43:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次看到你，就希望你得到幸福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have wished you joy since first I saw you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.52,1:44:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你想去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just where do you think you're off to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.00,1:44:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.52,1:44:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这次你要留下来，金雳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time you must stay, Gimli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.44,1:44:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不知道矮人族最固执吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you learned nothing of the stubbornness of Dwarves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.44,1:44:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你就认了吧，我们要跟你去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might as well accept it. We're going with you, laddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.40,1:44:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 么回事？ - 他要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening? - Where is he going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.92,1:44:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.36,1:44:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.84,1:45:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Aragorn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.04,1:45:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么在大战前夕离开？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he leave on the eve of battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.96,1:45:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他觉得没有希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He leaves because there is no hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.72,1:45:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他非走不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He leaves because he must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.00,1:45:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们势单力薄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too few have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.88,1:45:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能击败魔多大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot defeat the armies of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.56,1:45:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.64,1:45:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.76,1:45:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们还是要誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we will meet them in battle nonetheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.00,1:45:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我留下了指示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have left instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.44,1:45:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我死后人民要听你的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people are to follow your rule in my stead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.28,1:46:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,坐上我在金殿的王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take up my seat in the Golden Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.76,1:46:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不幸落败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long may you defend Edoras...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.76,1:46:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你要全力捍卫伊多拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the battle goes ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.20,1:46:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要我尽什么职责？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What other duty would you have me do, my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.84,1:46:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,职责？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.96,1:46:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.60,1:46:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望你能重展笑容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have you smile again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.12,1:46:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别再为死去的人难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not grieve for those whose time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.00,1:46:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你要率领洛汗人民重建家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall live to see these days renewed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.84,1:46:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不再悲伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no more despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.80,1:47:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么人会住在这种鬼地方？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of army would linger in such a place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.68,1:47:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,受到诅咒的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that is cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.48,1:47:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前亡灵之山的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long ago, the Men of the Mountains swore an oath...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.44,1:47:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,向刚铎最后一位人皇宣誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the last king of Gondor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.76,1:47:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他一声令下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come to his aid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.52,1:47:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就会前来奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.72,1:47:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当那一刻来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when the time came...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.52,1:47:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎的战况危急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when Gondor's need was dire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.32,1:47:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们却仓惶逃亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they fled...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.36,1:47:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,消失在亡灵之山的阴影中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vanishing into the darkness of the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.76,1:47:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,于是埃西铎诅咒他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so Isildur cursed them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.64,1:47:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在实现誓言之前，他们将永远不得安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never to rest until they had fulfilled their pledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.84,1:47:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能把他们从灰色的阴影中叫出来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who shall call them from the grey twilight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.48,1:47:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被遗忘的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The forgotten people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.88,1:47:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们誓言效忠人皇的继承人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heir of him to whom the oath they swore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.84,1:47:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他将从北方而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the north shall he come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.20,1:47:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他对他们有所要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need shall drive him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.96,1:48:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他将穿过黑暗之门，踏上亡者之道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shall pass the door to the Paths of the Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.96,1:48:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我全身的血液都结冰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The very warmth of my blood seems stolen away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.80,1:48:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗之门被封住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way is shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.52,1:48:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亡者打造的门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was made by those who are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.08,1:48:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,由他们负责掌管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Dead keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.88,1:48:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,路被封住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way is shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.76,1:48:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,布理哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brego!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.76,1:48:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not fear death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.80,1:49:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没听过有这种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is a thing unheard-of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.36,1:49:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,连精灵都肯进入地底，矮人却不敢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Elf will go underground where a Dwarf dare not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.20,1:49:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.72,1:49:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会被笑死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'd never hear the end of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.56,1:49:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,减轻负担、全速赶去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must ride light and swift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.00,1:49:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,前面的路很长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a long road ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.92,1:49:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,人和马都要保留精力，才能在战场上全力奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And man and beast must reach the end with the strength to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.48,1:49:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小哈比人不该上战场，梅里大爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Hobbits do not belong in war, Master Meriadoc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.84,1:49:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友都参战了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my friends have gone to battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.00,1:49:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我留下来会很丢脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would be ashamed to be left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.04,1:49:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,到米那斯提力斯要骑三天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a three-day gallop to Minas Tirith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.36,1:50:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我的骑士不能浪费力气载你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And none of my riders can bear you as a burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.72,1:50:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要参战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.36,1:50:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别再说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will say no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.16,1:50:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.56,1:50:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,王女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.16,1:50:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,整装出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Form up! Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.00,1:50:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,出发吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.40,1:50:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,前往刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride now to Gondor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.96,1:51:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.88,1:51:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.68,1:51:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到人影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see shapes of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.48,1:51:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还有马匹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.60,1:51:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.00,1:51:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,像云朵一般的白旗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pale banners like shreds of cloud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.36,1:51:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,高举的长矛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spears rise...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.20,1:51:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就像严冬里的枯树，刺向薄薄的迷雾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like winter-thickets through a shroud of mist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.92,1:51:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,后面跟着一群亡者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dead are following.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.28,1:51:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们受到召唤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have been summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.44,1:51:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,亡者？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.68,1:51:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,召唤？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Summoned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.80,1:52:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.00,1:52:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.48,1:52:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不怕咧，勒苟拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good! Legolas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.52,1:52:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别往下看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not look down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.52,1:53:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁闯入我的领土？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who enters my domain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.40,1:53:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要效忠的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One who will have your allegiance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.56,1:53:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,亡者不能容许活人过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dead do not suffer the living to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.24,1:54:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你要容许我过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will suffer me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.44,1:54:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗之门被封住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way is shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.00,1:54:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亡者打造的门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was made by those who are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.84,1:54:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,由他们负责掌管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Dead keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.12,1:54:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,路被封住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way is shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.96,1:54:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们非死不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you must die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.48,1:55:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我命令你实现你的誓言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I summon you to fulfill your oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.64,1:55:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只有刚铎人皇才能命令我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None but the king of Gondor may command me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.20,1:55:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,圣剑早就断裂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That line was broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.00,1:55:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,圣剑经过重铸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been remade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.12,1:55:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight for us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.84,1:55:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,重拾你们的尊严{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and regain your honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.56,1:55:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What say you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.12,1:55:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What say you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.40,1:55:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间，亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You waste your time, Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.36,1:55:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们活着没尊严，死后更没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had no honor in life, they have none now in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.04,1:56:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是埃西铎的子嗣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Isildur's heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.08,1:56:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只要为我作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight for me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.64,1:56:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的誓言就算实现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will hold your oaths fulfilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.12,1:56:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What say you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.00,1:56:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你们保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my word!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.52,1:56:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只要为我作战，我就把你们从死国放走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight, and I will release you from this living death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.00,1:56:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What say you?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.76,1:56:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,站出来，叛徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand, you traitors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.68,1:57:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.08,1:57:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,勒苟拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.80,1:57:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.32,1:58:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为你作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.76,1:58:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,把城门打开，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the gate! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.36,1:59:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.12,1:59:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.76,1:59:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say not that he has fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.16,1:59:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们寡不敌众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were outnumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.12,1:59:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人生还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.44,1:59:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.96,1:59:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,全城充满恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city is rank with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.52,2:00:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们为他们消除恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us ease their pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.24,2:00:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,把犯人还给他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.16,2:00:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catapults!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.48,2:00:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sons are spent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.96,2:00:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家族香火断绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My line has ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.72,2:00:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.32,2:00:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,宰相世家绝种了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The House of Stewards has failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.64,2:00:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大人，他需要救治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs medicine, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.16,2:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝子绝孙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My line has ended!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.32,2:00:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.84,2:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,洛汗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rohan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.40,2:01:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,抛弃了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has deserted us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.28,2:01:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,希优顿背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoden's betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.60,2:01:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,弃守吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon your posts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.48,2:01:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃吧，快逃命吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flee! Flee for your lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.56,2:01:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,准备迎敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for battle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.64,2:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快到墙边，保护城墙！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, men! To the wall! Defend the wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.96,2:01:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.68,2:01:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快回作战位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return to your posts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.88,2:02:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些怪物打下地狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send these foul beasts into the abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.68,2:02:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,留在原地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.12,2:02:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多石块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more rubble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.68,2:02:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.72,2:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,到下一层，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down to the lower levels. Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.16,2:02:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double up, men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.68,2:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢抗敌，不要被恐惧打败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold them back! Do not give in to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.20,2:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,坚守岗位、誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand to your posts! Fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.36,2:04:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要瞄准敌军的攻城塔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at the towers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.16,2:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准食人妖，歼灭食人妖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim for the trolls! Kill the trolls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.92,2:04:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们扳倒！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring them down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.84,2:05:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们击退！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight them back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.08,2:05:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peregrin Took!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.96,2:05:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快回去 - 你要我们誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go back to the Citadel! - They'd called us out to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.80,2:05:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哈比人不该上战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no place for a Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.92,2:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,回去捍卫碉堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard of the Citadel, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.00,2:06:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快回去，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, back, up the hill. Quickly. Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.68,2:06:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？没用的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, you useless scum?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.80,2:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,城门太坚固了，撞不破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door won't give. It's too strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.12,2:06:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回去把它撞破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back there and smash it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.68,2:06:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,用什么都撞不破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But nothing can breach it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.60,2:06:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,用葛龙德就可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grond will breach it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.28,2:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把破城鎚拉过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up the wolf's head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.52,2:07:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,葛龙德！葛龙德！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grond! Grond! Grond! Grond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.20,2:07:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,葛龙德！葛龙德！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grond! Grond! Grond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.96,2:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,葛龙德！葛龙德！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grond! Grond! Grond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.08,2:07:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,葛龙德！葛龙德！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grond! Grond! Grond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.20,2:07:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,葛龙德！葛龙德！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grond! Grond! Grond!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.20,2:07:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能继续前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may go no further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.20,2:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能进入刚铎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not enter Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.64,2:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是什么人，胆敢拦我们的路？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you to deny us passage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.12,2:08:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,勒苟拉斯，放一箭擦过掌帆手的耳边以示警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas, fire a warning shot past the bosun's ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.12,2:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind your aim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.36,2:08:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,活该，我们警告过你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Right. We warned you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.72,2:08:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,准备登船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to be boarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.64,2:08:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,登船？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boarded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.08,2:08:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就凭你们跟哪支军队？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By you and whose army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.24,2:08:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这支军队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.28,2:08:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.76,2:08:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.08,2:09:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,主人一定要进入隧道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master must go inside the tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.76,2:09:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我来到这儿，我突然不想进去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that I'm here, I don't think I want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.92,2:09:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.52,2:09:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不往前走…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.08,2:09:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,…就要回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.96,2:09:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.92,2:09:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是什么味道？ - 半兽人的臭味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that smell? - Orcses' filth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.80,2:09:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人有时候会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orcses come in here sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.00,2:09:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.80,2:09:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.60,2:10:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.32,2:10:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.80,2:10:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,黏答答的，这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sticky. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.12,2:10:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你待会就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.60,2:10:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.08,2:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你等着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.16,2:10:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.12,2:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.08,2:10:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.28,2:10:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.32,2:12:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你，佛罗多巴金斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, Frodo Baggins...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.60,2:12:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我将埃兰迪尔之光送给你，这是我们最挚爱的星辰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you the light of Earendil, our most beloved star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.80,2:12:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,愿它在所有光亮熄灭时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May it be a light for you in dark places...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.20,2:12:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在黑暗中为你照亮光明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when all other lights go out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.07,2:12:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语] 向最亮的星星致敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aiya Earendil Elenion Ancalima! (Hail Earendil brightest of the Stars!){\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.08,2:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,小小的苍蝇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naughty little fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.56,2:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么哭？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he cry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.32,2:14:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你被困在网中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caught in a web{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.84,2:14:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会被…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon you'll be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.92,2:14:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,吃掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.96,2:15:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你逃得了，是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got away, did it, precious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.80,2:15:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.12,2:15:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这次你休想逃 - 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not this time! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.00,2:15:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我们，不是我们干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't us. It wasn't us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.80,2:15:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈不会伤害主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol wouldn't hurt master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.64,2:15:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们答应过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.72,2:15:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你要相信我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must believe us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.36,2:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,都是宝贝害的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.28,2:15:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是宝贝逼我们这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The precious made us do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.16,2:15:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须摧毁魔戒，史麦戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to destroy it, Smeagol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.08,2:16:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了我们俩好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to destroy it for both our sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.56,2:16:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.20,2:16:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.08,2:16:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真是对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.40,2:17:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你被赋予这项任务，来自夏尔的佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This task was appointed to you, Frodo of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.36,2:17:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你无法完成任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do not find a way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.04,2:17:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,世界就会毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.12,2:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,斥候回报说，米那斯提力斯被团团包围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scouts report Minas Tirith is surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.96,2:18:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,底层全都被大火吞蚀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lower level's in flames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.76,2:18:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,敌军不断往前逼近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everywhere, legions of the enemy advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:07.36,2:18:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.16,2:18:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,准备作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.64,2:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,鼓起勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take heart, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:12.64,2:18:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,战争很快就结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will soon be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.48,2:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,王女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.68,2:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是这么地勇敢美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are fair and brave...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:20.52,2:18:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人生充满了希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have much to live for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.32,2:18:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也有很多人爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and many who love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.52,2:18:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道要回头已经太迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it is too late to turn aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.80,2:18:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道再怎么期望也没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know there is not much point now in hoping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.20,2:18:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望我是一个能成大事的洛汗骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were a knight of Rohan, capable of great deeds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.80,2:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.08,2:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是一个哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.64,2:18:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道我一个人救不了中土世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know I can't save Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.52,2:18:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想帮助我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to help my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.96,2:19:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.20,2:19:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.60,2:19:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.04,2:19:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是我希望能再见到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than anything, I wish I could see them again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.40,2:19:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,准备前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.88,2:19:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，我们要连夜赶路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make haste. We ride through the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.32,2:19:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.08,2:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.60,2:20:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,回去城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.64,2:20:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.76,2:20:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我是安那瑞安家族的宰相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am steward of the House of Anarion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.44,2:20:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾在这里昂首阔步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus have I walked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.96,2:20:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我要在这里长眠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thus now will I sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.16,2:20:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎已经沦陷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gondor is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.72,2:20:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,人类没有任何希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no hope for Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.80,2:21:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这些傻瓜逃什么逃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do the fools fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.16,2:21:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,早一点死不是比较好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better to die sooner than late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.32,2:21:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们迟早都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For die we must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.60,2:21:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耐瑟和法拉墨不需要坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tomb for Denethor and Faramir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.72,2:21:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会永远况睡等待腐朽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No long, slow sleep of death embalmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.96,2:21:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要跟先王一样被烧成灰烬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall burn, like the heathen kings of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.76,2:21:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把燃油和木柴拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring wood and oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.36,2:21:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.40,2:22:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是刚铎勇士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are soldiers of Gondor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.20,2:22:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不管有多少敌人，都要死守城门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what comes through that gate, you will stand your ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.08,2:22:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.20,2:22:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,放箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Volley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.40,2:22:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,放箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.48,2:24:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他，臭东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go, you filth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.40,2:24:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:32.36,2:24:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你休想动他一根汗毛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not touch him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.68,2:24:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有胆就来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on and finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.28,2:26:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.68,2:26:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.52,2:26:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.68,2:26:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.96,2:26:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.40,2:27:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.60,2:27:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别丢下我一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me here alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.48,2:27:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别去我不能跟去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go where I can't follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.20,2:27:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.28,2:27:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:31.64,2:27:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.32,2:27:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回来，臭东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get back, you scum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:03.40,2:28:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:05.92,2:28:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看来尸罗又跑出来打猎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like old Shelob's been having a bit of fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:10.64,2:28:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她又杀了一个猎物？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed another one, has she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:13.40,2:28:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.04,2:28:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这小子没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fellow ain't dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.40,2:28:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他没死？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.80,2:28:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她先用毒刺刺他，让他像死鱼一样动弹不得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She jabs him with her stinger, and he goes as limp as a boned fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:28.92,2:28:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她再慢慢享用大赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she has her way with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.08,2:28:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是她的独门秘方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how she likes to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.28,2:28:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,保持肉的鲜度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.56,2:28:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,把他抬到高塔上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him to the tower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.32,2:28:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆卫斯，你这个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Samwise, you fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:44.24,2:28:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这臭小子两小时后就会活过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This scum will be awake in a couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.24,2:28:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候他就会不想活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he'll wish he'd never been born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.00,2:29:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经没救了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house of his spirit crumbles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:18.32,2:29:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他在发烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.92,2:29:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他要燃烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.60,2:29:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:25.08,2:29:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.96,2:29:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.88,2:29:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.40,2:29:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没有死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.80,2:29:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 永别了，帕拉丁之子皮聘 - 不！不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Farewell, Peregrin, son of Paladin. - No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:39.44,2:29:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我解除你的职务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I release you from my service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.04,2:29:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么死就去死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now and die in what way seems best to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:50.60,2:29:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把燃油倒上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pour oil on the wood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:54.64,2:29:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快呀，别站在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, soldier! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.20,2:30:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点，动作快点 - 甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry along there! Hurry along! - Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:00.48,2:30:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.04,2:30:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.80,2:30:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,彻退！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.12,2:30:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,城门被攻陷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city is breached!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:15.04,2:30:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,回到上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back! To the second level!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:21.80,2:30:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让妇孺彻退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the women and children out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.72,2:30:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:25.68,2:30:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,彻退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:27.36,2:30:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快呀，来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:29.48,2:30:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,攻进城内、赶尽杀绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move into the city. Kill all in your path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.72,2:30:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,杀光所有的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:04.68,2:31:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗！奋战到底！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight! Fight to the last man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.72,2:31:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为生存战斗！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight for your lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:09.20,2:31:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.76,2:31:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:16.32,2:31:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耐瑟发疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Denethor has lost his mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:19.12,2:31:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他要把法拉墨活活烧死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's burning Faramir alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.56,2:31:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快上去，快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:30.16,2:31:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,回去黑暗深渊吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.16,2:31:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你的主人一起回到等着你们的深渊吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall into the nothingness that awaits you and your master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.56,2:31:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道你的死期到了吗？老家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not know death when you see it, old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.16,2:31:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:57.44,2:31:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.92,2:32:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.24,2:32:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,人类世界会灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world of Men will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:14.36,2:33:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鼓起勇气，梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courage, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:15.96,2:33:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们的朋友鼓起勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courage for our friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:21.88,2:33:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,组成阵形，笨蛋，组成阵形！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Form ranks, you maggots. Form ranks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:25.16,2:33:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,长矛手在前、弓箭手在后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pikes in front. Archers behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:36.48,2:33:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧墨，率兵攻击左翼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eomer, take your Eored down the left flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:39.80,2:33:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击左翼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flank ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.24,2:33:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,加姆林，跟着王旗向中锋进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamling, follow the king's banner down the center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:44.24,2:33:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,葛林伯，率领精兵攻击右翼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grimbold, take your company right after you pass the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:48.16,2:33:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,前进吧，别害怕黑暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forth, and fear no darkness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.08,2:33:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,起来吧，希优顿王的骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arise, arise, Riders of Theoden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:55.20,2:34:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,长矛向前刺、盾牌用力挡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spears shall be shaken... Shields shall be splintered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:00.56,2:34:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,举剑奋战、血染大地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a sword-day, a red day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:04.44,2:34:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要奋战到天明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the sun rises!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:15.80,2:34:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样都紧跟着我，我会保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happens, stay with me. I'll look after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:26.48,2:34:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.00,2:34:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:32.76,2:34:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,为了捍卫中土世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride! Ride for ruin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:35.68,2:34:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,勇往直前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the world's ending!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.40,2:34:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,誓死奋战！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.24,2:34:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,誓死奋战！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:45.32,2:34:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 誓死奋战！ - 誓死奋战！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Death! - Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.00,2:34:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 誓死奋战！ - 誓死奋战！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Death! - Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:51.28,2:34:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 誓死奋战！ - 誓死奋战！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Death! - Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:59.84,2:35:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊，伊欧子嗣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Eorlingas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:45.20,2:35:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,放箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.72,2:35:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,誓死奋战！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.16,2:35:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:57.88,2:35:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快放箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.88,2:37:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们身上点火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set a fire in our flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.80,2:37:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay this madness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.84,2:37:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你也许可以打一场胜仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may triumph in the field of battle for a day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:29.00,2:37:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当你面对从东方升起的邪恶力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but against the power that has risen in the east...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.80,2:37:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远无法获得胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:05.28,2:38:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:07.20,2:38:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能夺走我儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not take my son from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:10.00,2:38:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不！不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:23.28,2:38:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉墨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faramir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:38:38.52,2:38:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爱克西里昂之子迪耐瑟死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So passes Denethor, son of Ecthelion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:10.00,2:39:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们赶到河边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive them to the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:14.56,2:39:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,捍卫王都{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make safe the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:56.56,2:39:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,重组阵形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Re-form the line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:39:59.64,2:40:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,重组阵形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Re-form the line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:08.60,2:40:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,准备进攻，正面迎敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound the charge! Take them head-on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:40:11.80,2:40:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:41:25.24,2:41:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:01.04,2:42:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你来拉缰绳，往左拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the reins. Pull him left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:06.04,2:42:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,往左{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.72,2:42:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准他们的头放箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim for their heads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:32.40,2:42:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把他扳倒…把他扳倒…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it down! Bring it down! Bring it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:42:49.52,2:42:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:04.44,2:44:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到我的生命在这儿走到了尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think it would end this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:07.80,2:44:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,尽头？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:10.44,2:44:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这不是尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the journey doesn't end here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:15.04,2:44:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡只是另一条路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death is just another path...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:18.76,2:44:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要走的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one that we all must take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:21.72,2:44:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当灰色的天空放晴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The grey rain curtain of this world rolls back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:25.36,2:44:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,眼前一月银白透明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all turns to silver glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:31.16,2:44:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会看见它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:35.04,2:44:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:38.52,2:44:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看见什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:41.08,2:44:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洁白的海岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White shores...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:45.00,2:44:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,死后的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:48.88,2:44:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在黎明的晨曦中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A far green country...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:51.36,2:44:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有一片辽阔的绿茵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under a swift sunrise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:44:58.32,2:44:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哇塞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:00.00,2:45:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不错嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that isn't so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:01.84,2:45:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:05.28,2:45:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:23.36,2:45:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大家围过来，围过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rally to me! To me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:47.48,2:45:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好好享用他的肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feast on his flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:56.32,2:45:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢碰他我就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will kill you if you touch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:45:58.88,2:46:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别阻挡戒灵对他的猎物下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not come between the Nazgul and his prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:12.72,2:47:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们迟到了，混蛋海盗！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late as usual, pirate scum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:16.40,2:47:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,准备大开杀戒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's knife-work here needs doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:18.76,2:47:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，臭海盗，快滚下船！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you sea rats! Get off your ships!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:37.52,2:47:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再来比比看谁杀的敌人多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's plenty for the both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:39.76,2:47:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,最猛的矮人一定赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the best Dwarf win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:47:59.32,2:48:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你真蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:01.72,2:48:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有男人杀得了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man can kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:07.48,2:48:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,领死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:21.32,2:48:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am no man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:40.76,2:48:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 十五、十六 - 十七{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 15! 16! - 17!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:48:51.16,2:48:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:35.08,2:49:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,勒苟拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:49:59.28,2:50:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,三十三、三十四{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}33, 34.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:48.76,2:50:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那样也只能算一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That still only counts as one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:50:51.28,2:50:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好，来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, then. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:37.16,2:51:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我认得你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your face...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:41.88,2:51:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eowyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:46.32,2:51:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我就快死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My eyes darken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.84,2:51:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:52.00,2:51:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:55.76,2:51:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going to save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:51:59.56,2:52:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:05.56,2:52:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eowyn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:08.68,2:52:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的伤势太重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my body is broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:16.24,2:52:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你要让我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:24.64,2:52:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我将加入列祖列宗的行列{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go to my fathers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.68,2:52:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就算在伟大的先王身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in whose mighty company...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:31.92,2:52:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会感到羞愧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall not now feel ashamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.88,2:52:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伊欧玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eowyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:40.00,2:53:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:44.40,2:53:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最好不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:46.28,2:53:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这些死人头在危机时刻还挺有用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very handy in a tight spot, these lads, despite the fact they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:50.28,2:53:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave us your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:54.04,2:53:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们实现了誓言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hold your oath fulfilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:57.48,2:53:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:53:59.68,2:54:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,安息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be at peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:44.68,2:54:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:47.20,2:54:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:54:54.36,2:54:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:20.56,2:55:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,随着一声叹息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a sigh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:24.56,2:55:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你转身而去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turn away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:28.48,2:55:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,随着一阵心痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a deepening heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:32.60,2:55:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你已无话可说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more words to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:37.56,2:55:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:41.28,2:55:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,世界已经改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That the world has changed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:55:45.48,2:55:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,永远改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:14.28,2:56:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,树木从苍绿变成金黄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the trees are now turning from green to gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:25.96,2:56:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳也将西况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the sun is now fading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:31.44,2:56:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我能抱住你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could hold you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:38.28,2:56:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:43.84,2:56:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:56:46.64,2:56:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:00.08,2:57:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:04.32,2:57:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,梅里，是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:08.24,2:57:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是皮聘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Pippin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:12.28,2:57:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会找到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:14.72,2:57:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:18.32,2:57:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你要撇下我不管吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to leave me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:21.00,2:57:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不，梅里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Merry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:57:24.00,2:57:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要照顾你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to look after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:10.20,2:58:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.84,2:58:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那件银衣是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That shiny shirt, that's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:15.24,2:58:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把一切都交给伟大的邪眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to the Great Eye, along with everything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:20.92,2:58:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不听魔窟鼠辈的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take orders from stinking Morgul-rats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:25.64,2:58:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢碰它我就一剑把你刺死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You touch it, and I'll stick this blade in your gut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:51.52,2:58:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那混球想杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scum tried to knife me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:58:53.44,2:58:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,毙了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:38.40,3:00:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:40.84,3:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了夏尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for the Shire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:00:46.56,3:00:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了我的老爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's for my old Gaffer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:18.16,3:01:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别哎哎叫了，臭小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop your squealing, you dunghill rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:22.56,3:01:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要在你身上刺个透明窟窿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna bleed you like a stuck pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:34.68,3:01:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我先要你的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if I stick you first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:36.52,3:01:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:43.08,3:01:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆，对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Sam, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:45.28,3:01:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是对不起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:47.84,3:01:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我先把你救出去 - 太迟了，一切都完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get you out of here. - It's too late. It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:51.64,3:01:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把它拿走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken it. Sam...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:55.32,3:01:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把魔戒拿走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they took the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:01:57.60,3:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放心，他们并没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begging your pardon, but they haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:12.28,3:02:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd lost you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:14.88,3:02:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就把它拿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:17.76,3:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是保管它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only for safekeeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:21.08,3:02:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把它给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:26.40,3:02:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把魔戒给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the Ring, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:33.28,3:02:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:36.12,3:02:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,把魔戒交给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the Ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:02:58.80,3:03:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:03.56,3:03:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒是我的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring is my burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:06.60,3:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它会毁了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will destroy you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:11.88,3:03:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:15.20,3:03:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好找衣服穿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We best find you some clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:17.04,3:03:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能光着身子去魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't go walking through Mordor in naught but your skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:41.76,3:03:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:44.52,3:03:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于到了魔多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it to Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:48.12,3:03:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are so many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:50.72,3:03:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会被发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll never get through unseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:03:58.48,3:04:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是他，邪眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him, the Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:09.52,3:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们非去不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go in there, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:12.56,3:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没别的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:17.64,3:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，先下了山再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's just make it down the hill for starters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:31.44,3:04:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到佛罗多的行踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo has passed beyond my sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:36.00,3:04:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗笼罩大地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The darkness is deepening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:39.04,3:04:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果魔戒被索伦夺去就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Sauron had the Ring, we would know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:41.56,3:04:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是迟早的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:45.12,3:04:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他是吃了场败仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has suffered a defeat, yes but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:48.56,3:04:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他正在魔多重新集结大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind the walls of Mordor, our enemy is regrouping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:53.24,3:04:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,让他留在那里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:55.24,3:04:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让他去死吧，我们为什么要怕他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him rot! Why should we care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:04:58.08,3:05:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有一万名半兽人大军会阻止佛罗多前往末日火山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because 10,000 Orcs now stand between Frodo and Mount Doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:09.96,3:05:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我等于是让他去送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've sent him to his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:13.16,3:05:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.52,3:05:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多仍有一线希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is still hope for Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:18.60,3:05:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要时间穿越葛哥洛斯平原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs time and safe passage across the plains of Gorgoroth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:23.80,3:05:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们能替他争取时间 - 该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can give him that. - How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:26.68,3:05:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把索伦的大军引出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw out Sauron's armies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:29.60,3:05:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让魔多变成空城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empty his lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:31.96,3:05:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们以全部兵力攻打黑门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we gather our full strength and march on the Black Gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:35.68,3:05:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的兵力不能打败敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot achieve victory through strength of arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:38.84,3:05:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不必打败他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:40.64,3:05:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只要让索伦心无旁骛专心地对付我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can give Frodo his chance if we keep Sauron's Eye fixed upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:48.00,3:05:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多就有成功的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep him blind to all else that moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:52.52,3:05:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,声东击西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:53.92,3:05:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,成功机率很小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainty of death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:55.84,3:05:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且必死无疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}small chance of success...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:05:59.52,3:06:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们还在等什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:01.68,3:06:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦一定会起疑心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron will suspect a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:04.84,3:06:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会上当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not take the bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:08.44,3:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他会上当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I think he will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:45.36,3:06:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在猎杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long have you hunted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:48.88,3:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一直在躲着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long have I eluded you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:52.00,3:06:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不再躲藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:06:55.24,3:06:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的伊兰迪尔圣剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold the Sword of Elendil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:42.16,3:07:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,整座城市静悄悄的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city has fallen silent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:46.36,3:07:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳没有一丝暖意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no warmth left in the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:50.16,3:07:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,空气越来越冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It grows so cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:07:54.92,3:07:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,下了第一阵春雨才会这么潮湿冰冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just the damp of the first spring rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:04.32,3:08:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信黑暗很快就会过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not believe this darkness will endure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:36.16,3:08:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你看，那些半兽人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the Orcs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:38.32,3:08:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're moving off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:41.36,3:08:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你看吧，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Mr. Frodo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:43.60,3:08:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于有好运气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some luck at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:46.12,3:08:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快点，懒虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, you slugs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:08:49.20,3:08:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:00.56,3:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快跟上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along, you coldhearted wretched scum...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:04.04,3:09:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就把你打到皮开肉绽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll whip you down to the bone, you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:11.16,3:09:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:12.92,3:09:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我是怎么跟你们说的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I told you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:18.64,3:09:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,行动起来！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:22.12,3:09:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:24.00,3:09:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，懒惰鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you slugs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:26.84,3:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个到前面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two are going straight to the front line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:30.64,3:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，走快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, move it! Go on! Fall in! Move it! Move it! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:09:48.56,3:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快到大门去，臭懒虫，快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the Gate, you slugs! Now, move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:01.76,3:10:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道我们在打仗吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know we're at war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:27.64,3:10:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Company, halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:34.36,3:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspection!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:37.92,3:10:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,山姆，帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:40.56,3:10:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:45.08,3:10:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,起来，佛罗多，快起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand up, Mr. Frodo. Stand up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:47.80,3:10:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,它好重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:10:58.76,3:10:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:05.56,3:11:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do? What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:10.64,3:11:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打我 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hit me. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:11.96,3:11:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,打我，假装打架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me, Sam. Start fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:14.16,3:11:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:16.36,3:11:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人敢惹我，你这臭东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody pushes me, you filthy maggot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:27.36,3:11:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:30.36,3:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别打了，别打了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it up! Break it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:34.80,3:11:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不乖乖住手，我就把你开膛剖肚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi! I'll have your guts if you don't shut this rabble down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:39.52,3:11:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧，山姆，快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Sam. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:50.84,3:11:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move along, scum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:52.52,3:11:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,回到队伍里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in the line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:54.92,3:11:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,臭东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You maggots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:11:57.36,3:12:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back into the line, you slugs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:02.84,3:12:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，懒惰鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig it, you slugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:09.00,3:12:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:55.12,3:12:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:12:57.28,3:13:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我撑不下去了，我承受不了魔戒的压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't... I can't manage the Ring, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:01.28,3:13:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它…它…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's... It's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:02.56,3:13:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它真的好沉重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's such a weight to carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:06.04,3:13:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,它…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:07.20,3:13:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,重到令人受不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:14.16,3:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要走那里，尽量直直走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going that way. Straight as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:18.08,3:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要的东西说不必带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no point carrying anything we're not sure to need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:36.36,3:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:39.68,3:13:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:43.80,3:13:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有光亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:46.00,3:13:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好耀眼的光亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and beauty up there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:13:48.52,3:13:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没有阴影能盖住它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that no shadow can touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:41.32,3:14:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:14:43.48,3:14:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,里面还有几滴水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a few drops left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:00.80,3:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可是回程就没水喝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be none left for the return journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:15:04.28,3:15:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们是回不去了，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think there will be a return journey, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:00.36,3:16:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，快趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo, get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:04.28,3:16:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快躲起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:16.32,3:16:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:16:24.28,3:16:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:01.68,3:17:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗魔君快现身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the Lord of the Black Land come forth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:05.68,3:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他就地伏法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let justice be done upon him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:17:52.04,3:17:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人索伦欢迎你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My master, Sauron the Great, bids thee welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:01.80,3:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们哪一位可以代表跟我谈判？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any in this rout with authority to treat with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:05.92,3:18:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是来跟索伦谈判的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not come to treat with Sauron...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:09.20,3:18:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那个受诅咒的恶魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}faithless and accursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:12.32,3:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你的主人，魔多大军必须解散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your master this: The armies of Mordor must disband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:15.92,3:18:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他要离开中土世界，永远不再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is to depart these lands, never to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:19.60,3:18:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,灰胡子老爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old Greybeard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:23.60,3:18:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一些信物要给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a token I was bidden to show thee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:32.88,3:18:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:37.08,3:18:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:39.48,3:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安静 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Silence. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:41.56,3:18:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:44.72,3:18:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,原来那个半身人对你们这么重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Halfling was dear to thee, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:49.44,3:18:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我们手上受了很痛苦的折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know that he suffered greatly at the hands of his host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:18:59.04,3:19:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会料到这个小人儿能忍受这么大的痛苦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would've thought one so small could endure so much pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:07.44,3:19:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他被折磨得不成人形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he did, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:09.72,3:19:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦不堪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:18.48,3:19:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:20.16,3:19:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,埃西铎的子嗣？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isildur's heir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:22.36,3:19:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,想要当人皇光有一把破烂的精灵宝剑还不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes more to make a king than a broken Elvish blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:30.16,3:19:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜咱们的谈判结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that concludes negotiations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:34.84,3:19:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:38.04,3:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:55.52,3:19:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,往后退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:19:57.64,3:19:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,往后退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:11.88,3:20:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,它走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:16.36,3:20:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那道光往北方移过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The light's passed on, away towards the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:19.60,3:20:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它被什么引开来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's drawn its gaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:38.88,3:20:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住，稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your ground! Hold your ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:43.72,3:20:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎和洛汗的好男儿，我的好兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sons of Gondor, of Rohan, my brothers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:50.60,3:20:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你们眼中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see in your eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:52.92,3:20:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看见我心中也威受到的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the same fear that would take the heart of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:20:58.92,3:21:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天人类将失去勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A day may come when the courage of Men fails...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:03.00,3:21:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会众叛亲离、一败涂地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we forsake our friends and break all bonds of fellowship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:06.44,3:21:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是在今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is not this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:09.44,3:21:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天邪将胜正{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour of wolves and shattered shields...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:12.60,3:21:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的世界也会完全毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the age of Men comes crashing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:15.64,3:21:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是在今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is not this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:18.28,3:21:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们要誓死奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This day we fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:21.76,3:21:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你们在世上所珍惜的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all that you hold dear on this good earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:21:26.28,3:21:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要奋战到底，西方的人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bid you stand, Men of the West!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:22:59.00,3:23:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没想过我会跟一个精灵一起战死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never thought I'd die fighting side by side with an Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:03.00,3:23:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一个朋友一起战死呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about side by side with a friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:08.88,3:23:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:11.48,3:23:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:43.60,3:23:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多，你还记得夏尔吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember the Shire, Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:48.60,3:23:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,春天就快来到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be spring soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:51.68,3:23:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,果树都会开花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the orchards will be in blossom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:54.56,3:23:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟儿也会在榛树上筑巢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the birds will be nesting in the hazel thicket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:23:59.60,3:24:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,人们很快就要收割大麦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they'll be sowing the summer barley in the lower fields...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:04.60,3:24:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,沾鲜奶油吃初摘的草莓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and eating the first of the strawberries with cream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:10.96,3:24:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得草莓的味道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember the taste of strawberries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:15.04,3:24:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:16.92,3:24:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得食物的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't recall the taste of food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:20.96,3:24:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也不记得流水声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor the sound of water...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:24.44,3:24:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,或是稻草香{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor the touch of grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:28.96,3:24:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:31.44,3:24:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,…赤裸裸站在黑暗中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}naked in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:34.48,3:24:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟邪眼之问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's... there's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:36.92,3:24:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何阻隔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No veil between me and the wheel of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:42.84,3:24:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的双眼…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:45.24,3:24:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,…清楚地看到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my waking eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:47.92,3:24:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把它毁掉吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let us be rid of it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:51.00,3:24:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让它永远消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:53.96,3:24:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:56.16,3:24:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能替你背负这重担{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't carry it for you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:24:59.24,3:25:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我可以背你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can carry you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:01.84,3:25:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:34.00,3:25:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,亚拉冈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aragorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:25:48.48,3:25:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伊力萨王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elessar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:03.04,3:26:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为了佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:40.44,3:26:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你看，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:42.64,3:26:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一道门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:45.44,3:26:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:26:49.44,3:26:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明的哈比人爬到这么高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clever Hobbits to climb so high!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:07.36,3:27:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不能去那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mustn't go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:10.60,3:27:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不能毁了宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mustn't hurt the precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:13.16,3:27:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你发过誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You swore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:15.12,3:27:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你对着宝贝发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You swore on the precious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:19.08,3:27:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈发过誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol promised!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:27:21.96,3:27:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,史麦戈是骗你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smeagol lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:16.48,3:28:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:45.44,3:28:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,巨鹰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eagles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:28:48.60,3:28:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,巨鹰来帮忙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eagles are coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:12.92,3:29:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:20.08,3:29:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:28.84,3:29:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,毁了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:41.04,3:29:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，快呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:29:44.44,3:29:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,把它丢进烈焰中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw it in the fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:00.40,3:30:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:04.96,3:30:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let it go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:40.48,3:30:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:46.32,3:30:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:48.52,3:30:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:30:58.20,3:31:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:45.28,3:32:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:48.36,3:32:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:32:51.20,3:32:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝！宝贝！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precious! Precious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:33:50.36,3:33:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把手伸出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:00.52,3:34:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:05.64,3:34:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:14.20,3:34:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:20.72,3:34:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:34:23.92,3:34:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:35:54.60,3:35:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:35:58.04,3:36:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:37:22.40,3:37:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,它不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:37:28.76,3:37:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,任务完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:37:30.96,3:37:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:37:34.36,3:37:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:02.44,3:38:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得见夏尔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:07.00,3:38:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,烈酒河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Brandywine River.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:11.44,3:38:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,袋底洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bag End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:15.80,3:38:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫的烟火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf's fireworks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:18.96,3:38:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,宴会树上的灯光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lights in the Party Tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:24.16,3:38:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小玟卡顿在跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosie Cotton dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:28.48,3:38:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她头上绑了丝带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had ribbons in her hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:34.08,3:38:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我要娶老婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If ever I was to marry someone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:37.96,3:38:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要娶她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would've been her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:41.64,3:38:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会是她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would've been her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:38:55.92,3:38:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴有你在，山姆卫斯詹吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad to be with you, Samwise Gamgee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:39:03.32,3:39:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,陪我一起走到尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here at the end of all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:40:55.96,3:40:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:41:17.64,3:41:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:41:39.44,3:41:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,金雳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:43:24.28,3:43:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,人皇的时代来临了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now come the days of the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:43:33.04,3:43:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,愿神祝福你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May they be blessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:43:55.64,3:43:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这一天的荣耀不是属于一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This day does not belong to one man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:43:58.48,3:44:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而是属于每一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:01.96,3:44:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们同心协力重建家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us together rebuild this world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:05.08,3:44:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一起分享太平盛世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we may share in the days of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:21.58,3:44:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,# [精灵语] 走出大海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}# Et Earello... (Out of the Great Sea...){\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:26.01,3:44:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,# [精灵语] 去往中土大陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}# Endorenna utulien. (to Middle-Earth I am come.){\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:34.92,3:44:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,# [精灵语] 我要住在这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}# Sinome maruvan... (In this place will I abide...){\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:39.62,3:44:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,# [精灵语] 和我的子孙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}# ar Hildinyar... (and my heirs...){\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:44:46.39,3:44:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,# [精灵语] 直到世界末日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}# tenn' Ambar-metta. (unto the ending of the world.){\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:45:03.91,3:45:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[精灵语] 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hannon le. (Thank you.){\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:46:43.80,3:46:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:46:51.16,3:46:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不必向任何人鞠躬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you bow to no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:47:38.00,3:47:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,故事终于告一段落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thus it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:47:40.36,3:47:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,中土世界第四纪元就此展开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Fourth Age of Middle-earth began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:47:44.16,3:47:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,至于魔戒远征队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Fellowship of the Ring...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:47:46.84,3:47:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们的友谊永远长存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though eternally bound by friendship and love...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:47:51.52,3:47:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但是也该曲终人散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:47:58.96,3:48:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫派我们踏上这段旅程的十三个月后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirteen months to the day since Gandalf sent us on our long journey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:48:03.88,3:48:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于再度看到熟悉的景象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we found ourselves looking upon a familiar sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:48:10.68,3:48:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:48:19.88,3:48:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:48:39.00,3:48:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小心我的南瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch the pumpkin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:49:29.28,3:49:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一杯，小玟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More of the same, Rosie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:49:31.00,3:49:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安，各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:30.60,3:50:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你该如何重拾往日的生活？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you pick up the threads of an old life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:35.92,3:50:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你该怎么继续下去？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you go on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:38.32,3:50:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当你在内心深处早就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when in your heart you begin to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:44.80,3:50:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你已无法回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no going back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:48.40,3:50:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事情无法弥补{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are some things that time cannot mend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:52.64,3:50:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有些伤痛太深沉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some hurts that go too deep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:50:57.28,3:51:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你将永远无法复元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that have taken hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:51:20.84,3:51:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(历险归来: 哈比人的故事  比尔博巴金斯著)
Dialogue: 0,3:51:38.24,3:51:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Frodo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:51:43.52,3:51:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:51:46.72,3:51:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我在风云顶上被刺这一剑，到现在已经过了四年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been four years to the day since Weathertop, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:51:51.36,3:51:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伤口还是没有完全愈合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never really healed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:51:58.00,3:52:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,历险归来: 哈比人的故事，比尔博巴金斯著{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There and Back Again." A Hobbit's tale by Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:04.04,3:52:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒之王，佛罗多巴金斯著{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And "The Lord of the Rings" by Frodo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:08.28,3:52:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你写完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You finished it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:13.32,3:52:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:15.68,3:52:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一些故事没写完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's room for a little more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:20.88,3:52:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博曾说他的故事终会结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo once told me his part in this tale would end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:25.28,3:52:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人的生命都有精采的一页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that each of us must come and go in the telling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:29.44,3:52:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他的故事已经结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo's story was now over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:32.76,3:52:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博即将踏上…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There would be no more journeys for him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:35.80,3:52:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,…最后的旅程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}save one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:38.16,3:52:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再告诉我，我们要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me again, lad, where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:41.88,3:52:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,去港口呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the harbor, Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:44.04,3:52:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵赐给你最高的荣誉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Elves have accorded you a special honor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:46.96,3:52:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他们一起搭船离闭中土世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a place on the last ship to leave Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:51.28,3:52:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frodo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:54.32,3:52:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我能再见到那只戒指吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any chance of seeing that old Ring of mine again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:52:59.52,3:53:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你的那只戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one I gave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:53:05.40,3:53:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:53:10.12,3:53:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:53:12.88,3:53:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:53:15.36,3:53:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:53:19.52,3:53:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想再持有它最后一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should like to have held it one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:53:52.56,3:53:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我没见过这么大的场面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's a sight I have never seen before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:54:11.84,3:54:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵族的三只魔戒力量已消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power of the Three Rings is ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:54:15.92,3:54:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,人类统治的时代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time has come...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:54:18.92,3:54:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,已经来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the dominion of Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:54:23.28,3:54:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大海在召唤我们回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Aear can ven na mar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:54:34.60,3:54:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:54:36.92,3:54:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好再踏上另一场冒险之旅了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quite ready for another adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:12.36,3:55:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,再会吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:14.80,3:55:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢的哈比人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my brave Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:19.52,3:55:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的任务已经完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My work is now finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:25.48,3:55:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在这大海的岸边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here at last, on the shores of the sea...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:31.00,3:55:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,魔戒远征队终于解散了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comes the end of our Fellowship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:37.36,3:55:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会叫你们不要哭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not say, "Do not weep"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:55:40.52,3:55:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有些泪水是好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for not all tears are an evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:02.16,3:56:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了，佛罗多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time, Frodo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:09.60,3:56:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does he mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:14.04,3:56:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的任务是拯救夏尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We set out to save the Shire, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:18.52,3:56:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔安然无恙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it has been saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:24.96,3:56:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不能留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:28.56,3:56:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:32.20,3:56:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,3:56:42.72,3:56:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,最后几页是留给你的，山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last pages are for you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:18.56,4:00:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Sam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:23.32,4:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能一心两用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot always be torn in two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:26.84,4:00:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须全心全意为家庭奉献{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will have to be one and whole for many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:31.76,4:00:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你有好多事要做，有好多福可享{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have so much to enjoy and to be and to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:38.48,4:00:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在故事中的角色将继续下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your part in the story will go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:42.36,4:00:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,4:00:45.96,4:00:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back.{\r}
